METADATA_LABEL_RE = re.compile(r"\s*\b(?:journal[- ]ref|journal reference|journal|venue|doi|arxiv(?:\s*id)?|publisher|comments|url)\s*[:\-]", re.I)
def strip_metadata_tail(s):
    m = METADATA_LABEL_RE.search(s)
    if m and m.start() > 40:  # only if there is quoted content before it
        return s[:m.start()].strip()
    return s
```
